  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:380px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-Magenta pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Mana Draining Field Projection</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/c/c4/Gwen_Tennyson_Vs_Charmcaster.gif/revision/latest?cb=20190113171026\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Gwen Tennyson Vs Charmcaster\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/c/c4/Gwen_Tennyson_Vs_Charmcaster.gif/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20190113171026\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/c/c4/Gwen_Tennyson_Vs_Charmcaster.gif/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20190113171026 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/c/c4/Gwen_Tennyson_Vs_Charmcaster.gif/revision/latest?cb=20190113171026 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Gwen Tennyson Vs Charmcaster\" width=\"270\" height=\"153\" data-image-key=\"Gwen_Tennyson_Vs_Charmcaster.gif\" data-image-name=\"Gwen Tennyson Vs Charmcaster.gif\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Gwen Tennyson (Ben 10: Alien Force) used two spells to protect her from Charmcaster’s enhanced magic and to take back her Anodite powers back from Charmcaster who stole them from her earlier to enhanced her own and briefly make herself an Anodite.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Project a field that drains mana.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<p>The power to <b>project a field that drains mana</b>. Sub-power of <a href=\"/wiki/Mana_Manipulation\" title=\"Mana Manipulation\">Mana Manipulation</a>. Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Draining_Field_Projection\" title=\"Draining Field Projection\">Draining Field Projection</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Known_Powers/Spells\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Powers/Spells</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Videos\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Videos</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FMana_Draining_Field_Projection%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Users can generate a field that drains all mana inside of it. In most cases, these fields, which are often spherical in shape and range, can be made to selectively target specific subjects, including entities, objects, powers, concepts, etc., or be made to target everything inside them and affect entire areas indiscriminately.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FMana_Draining_Field_Projection%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Draining_Field_Projection\" title=\"Draining Field Projection\">Draining Field Projection</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Effect_Field_Projection\" title=\"Effect Field Projection\">Effect Field Projection</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Drain\" title=\"Energy Drain\">Energy Drain</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Magical_Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Magical Energy Absorption\">Magical Energy Absorption</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FMana_Draining_Field_Projection%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Field is limited to draining mana, it doesn't <a href=\"/wiki/Absorption\" title=\"Absorption\">absorb</a> it.</li>\n<li>It's useless against people who don't rely on mana in order to fight.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FMana_Draining_Field_Projection%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://dragonschef.fandom.com/wiki/Lloyd_Frontera\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:the-greatest-estate-developer:Lloyd Frontera\">Kim Suho/Lloyd Frontera</a> (<i>The Greatest Estate Developer</i>)</li>\n<li>Mana Users (<i>Ben 10 series</i>)\n<ul><li>Charmcaster</li>\n<li>Gwen Tennyson</li>\n<li>Verdona Tennyson</li></ul></li>\n<li>Valério Calvados (<i>Dog Days</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://typemoon.fandom.com/wiki/Satsuki_Yumizuka\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:typemoon:Satsuki Yumizuka\">Satsuki Yumizuka</a> (<i>TYPE-MOON</i>)</li></ul>\n<h2><span id=\"Known_Powers.2FSpells\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Powers/Spells\">Known Powers/Spells</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FMana_Draining_Field_Projection%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Reverto Meus Ops Mihi (<i>Ben 10</i>)</li>\n<li>Contego (<i>Ben 10</i>)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FMana_Draining_Field_Projection%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-i